{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>注重私隱的經期記錄工具 SafeCycle Pro 現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。程式以「資料不離開手機」為設計原則，適合不希望生理週期紀錄上傳雲端或與第三方分享的使用者。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-81.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>本地加密與偽裝計算機</h2>\n<p>SafeCycle Pro 不具備網絡存取權限，資料在技術上無法傳送至任何地方。所有紀錄以 AES-256-GCM 加密保存於裝置本地，並支援 Face ID 或 Touch ID 解鎖。雙 PIN 設計將真實資料與偽裝計算機分開，輸入偽裝 PIN 只會顯示可正常運作的計算機。程式亦提供智能週期預測、每日症狀記錄與圖表分析，提醒通知以「Daily Reminder」顯示，不在鎖定畫面透露內容。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-510-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-511-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-512-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-513-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：SafeCycle Pro</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/safecycle-pro/id6763440825?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.658768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":352,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:24:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:38:50.186937+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:48.302392+00:00","content_hash":"b993f3851862f538ecb9e518b4472b706d03c9bf417771c8fea4a39a69ee4321","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}